 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "I live in a very old town which is surrounded by beautiful woods.",
   "zh": "我住在一个由美丽的树林环绕的古老小镇上。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 10,
    "end": 18.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "It is a famous beauty spot.",
   "zh": "这是一个著名的风景胜地。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 18.6,
    "end": 21.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "On Sundays, hundreds of people come from the city to see our town and to walk through the woods.",
   "zh": "每逢星期天，有许许多多人从城里来观赏我们的小镇，并在树林中散步。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 21.9,
    "end": 31.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Visitors have been asked to keep the woods clean and tidy.",
   "zh": "游客已被告知要保持树林的整洁。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 31.4,
    "end": 37.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Litter baskets have been placed under the trees,",
   "zh": "树下都已设置了废物筐，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 37.5,
    "end": 41.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "but people still throw their rubbish everywhere.",
   "zh": "但是人们仍到处扔垃圾。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 41.7,
    "end": 46.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Last Wednesday, I went for a walk in the woods.",
   "zh": "上星期三我到树林里去散步。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 46.3,
    "end": 51.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "What I saw made me very sad.",
   "zh": "我所见到的一切使我非常难过。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 51.1,
    "end": 54.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "I counted seven old cars and three old refrigerators.",
   "zh": "我数了一下，有7辆旧汽车和3个旧冰箱。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 54.2,
    "end": 62.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The litter baskets were empty",
   "zh": "废物筐是空的，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 62.4,
    "end": 65.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "and the ground was covered with pieces of paper, cigarette ends, old tyres, empty bottles and rusty tins.",
   "zh": "而满地都是纸片、烟头、旧轮胎、空瓶子和生锈的空罐头盒。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 65.5,
    "end": 77.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Among the rubbish, I found a sign which said,",
   "zh": "在垃圾堆中我发现了一块牌子，上面写着：",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 77.9,
    "end": 82.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Anyone who leaves litter in these woods will be prosecuted!'",
   "zh": "“凡在此树林里丢弃垃圾者，将依法处置。”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L143.mp4",
    "start": 82.4,
    "end": 89.2
   }
  }
 ],
